00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.135 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Hey, that's cool, man.

00:00:35.135 --> 00:00:36.736 line:92%
We're all in this together.

00:00:36.736 --> 00:00:37.337 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
